40770","kind":"update","title":"Patch v0.4.1 — A Smoother Start & Automatic Graphics Settings","summary":"* Automatic Graphics Settings — Graphics settings are now chosen based on your graphics card.* Upgrade Catalog — A catalog in the starting room opens the upgrade book.* Tools in Boxes — The rake and the vacuum now wait in boxes in the starting room. Their boxes open once the second and third areas are cleared.* Bale Truck Indicator — A badge in the top left shows when a bale truck is at its dock.* Collecting by hand no longer needs an upgrade. Just hold the button.* The Tab icon now pulses after","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T21:00:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692739","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5140770-1846651706687933","game_id":"steam-5140770","kind":"update","title":"New Update — The Main Barn, Toy Helpers, a New Machine & Much More","summary":"This update opens our biggest area yet and brings little helpers that work the farm for you, a brand-new machine, collectibles, and plenty of improvements!New Content & Gameplay* The Main Barn — A large new area with its own story, sticky hay patches and suction grates.* Paper Machine — A new machine in the Main Barn turns hay into paper rolls. Rolls are worth more than bales, and each one is tied with a rope colored by its quality level.* Toy Trucks — Buy toy trucks at the new Toy Machine. They","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T20:19:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687933","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5140770-1846018067938093","game_id":"steam-5140770","kind":"update","title":"Major Update - v0.3.0","summary":"New Update — Two New Areas, Perks, Improvements & Bug FixesThis update brings two new areas to explore, new gameplay mechanics, accessibility improvements, and several important bug fixes!New Content & GameplayTwo New Areas Added — Two brand-new areas are now available to explore.Painting Puzzle Added — Find all 6 missing pieces and place them correctly to complete the puzzle.Sticky Hay Mechanic Added — Some hay is now stuck firmly to the floor. Picking it up by hand takes several attempts, whil","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T09:49:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067938093","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5140770-1846018067937210","game_id":"steam-5140770","kind":"announcement","title":"Now Available on macOS!","summary":"We’re happy to announce that Story of The Needle In a Haystack is now playable on macOS! Mac players can now jump into the barn, clear the hay, uncover the story, and enjoy the demo on Steam.And there’s much more on the way! A major update is coming soon, bringing big improvements, new content, and brand-new rooms to explore in the coming days.Thank you so much for all your support. 🌾— Rebel Pickle","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T20:04:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067937210","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5140770-1845383656391399","game_id":"steam-5140770","kind":"announcement","title":"New Machine is Here!","summary":"We have a new machine! with some improvements and bug fixes.Added a grate and an automatic sack-filling device, which can speed up your hay gathering!Added an indicator showing the baling machine’s current hay amount and capacity.Story elements have been added.Collected story documents are now removed from the world and can be reread from the inventory.Adjusted the truck’s collision boundaries for more reliable loading.Improved the visibility of notes and newspapers on walls and near the chest.R","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-04T14:23:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656391399","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5140770-1844751498228054","game_id":"steam-5140770","kind":"announcement","title":"Improvements - v0.1.1","summary":"We have made some improvements.When only a small amount of hay remains, you can now press H to highlight nearby hay and make it easier to find.Story elements have been added.Fixed text overflow issues in input prompts.If the truck still has money in it when a bale is thrown in, the money will now be collected automatically.Fixed a floor bump in Entrance that could hide pieces of hay.Save files are now versioned. Because of this change, older save files will be reset.Throwing is now faster.Throwi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-26T20:41:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498228054","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5140770-1844751498225244","game_id":"steam-5140770","kind":"announcement","title":"Story of The Needle In a Haystack Demo is Live!","summary":"Hi everyone! The moment is finally here. We are incredibly excited to announce that the Story of The Needle In a Haystack Demo is officially live and ready to play right now on Steam!You can now dive in and start searching for the needle while experiencing the story behind it. Share Your Feedback & WishlistSince this is the first version of demo on Steam, your thoughts mean the world. Whether you find a bug or just want to tell what you think about the demo, please let me know in the Discord cha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T16:43:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498225244","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5140770":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:53Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:53Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5140770":"2026-10-26T08:45:53Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5140770":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:53Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:53Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:53Z"},"5279300":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:53Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:53Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:53Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5140770","app_id":5140770,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:35Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"a6d6f17e9e5ce970bfe4f842244a4610056f87dbc3cedf97fff095b5953bf5f1","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"매력적인 스토리가 담긴 아늑한 협동 정리 게임입니다. 건초로 가득 찬 오래된 헛간을 청소하고, 여러 방을 탐험하며, 도구를 업그레이드하고, 수집한 물건을 판매하세요. 친구들과 힘을 합쳐 작은 바늘을 찾으며 숨겨진 이야기를 밝혀내세요.","publishers":[{"name":"Rebel Pickle Games","creator_clan_account_id":46070796}],"developers":[{"name":"Rebel Pickle Games","creator_clan_account_id":46070796}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1795806000,"is_comi